compare_destinations: inputSchema  parameters: -slugs; +slugs, or each destination's own published name in English or Czech (e.g. 'turkey', 'Bulharsko'); resort keys are not accepted here;
current_vs_history: inputSchema  parameters: -interchangeable. +interchangeable, and the destination's own published name in English or Czech (e.g. 'thailand', 'Řecko') resolves to that same page.
price_history: inputSchema  parameters: -interchangeable. +interchangeable, and the destination's own published name in English or Czech (e.g. 'thailand', 'Řecko') resolves to that same page.

shorti_arena: inputSchema  parameters: -input.cursor description: A previous answer's next_cursor. -input.limit description: How many rows a page.
shorti_edit_recipe: inputSchema  parameters: -input.cursor description: A previous answer's next_cursor. -summary: the compact answer, prompts for a model marked for_model. -format: alone, its plan on its reference hit's clock; +format; -that format. +it. -'en' answers in +'en': -English: +English;
shorti_find: inputSchema  parameters: -input.cursor description: A previous answer's next_cursor. -'en' answers in +'en': -English: +English; -input.limit description: How many formats a page.
shorti_flow: inputSchema  parameters: -'en' answers in +'en': -English: +English;
shorti_format: description, inputSchema  -By `format_id`, or `video_id`/`url` of one of its videos.  parameters: -input.cursor description: A previous answer's next_cursor. -summary: the compact answer, prompts for a model marked for_model. -'en' answers in +'en': -English: +English;
shorti_my_field: inputSchema  parameters: -words: 피부과, 치과, 약사, 변호사, 세무사, 공인중개사, 브랜드 담당자, 뷰티, 맛집 체험단, 카페 사장, 미용실, 배우, dermatologist, lawyer, realtor, brand team, salon … +words. -'en' answers in +'en': -English: +English;
shorti_remake_recipe: inputSchema  parameters: -input.cursor description: A previous answer's next_cursor. -summary: the compact answer, prompts for a model marked for_model. -format: alone, its reference hit; +format; -that format. +it. -'en' answers in +'en': -English: +English; -description: What the remake changes. input.mode -plan the answer carries: by default +plan: -request +request, or all with detail='full' -model's); with detail='full' its +model's, or -request (else every model's): seedance-2.5, minimax-h3, kling-3.0-motion-control, wan-3.0. +model's). -"wan-3.0"] +"wan-3.0", "gemini-omni-1.1-flash"]
shorti_scene_get: description, inputSchema  -`video` (a video_id or post link): +`video`:  parameters: -input.cursor description: A previous answer's next_cursor. -summary: the compact answer, prompts for a model marked for_model. -'en' answers in +'en': -English: +English;
shorti_scene_kit: description, inputSchema  -`video` (a video_id or post link): +`video`:  parameters: -input.cursor description: A previous answer's next_cursor. -summary: the compact answer, prompts for a model marked for_model. -'en' answers in +'en': -English: +English; -plan the answer carries: by default +plan: -request +request, or all with detail='full' -model's); with detail='full' its +model's, or -request (else every model's): seedance-2.5, minimax-h3, kling-3.0-motion-control, wan-3.0. +model's).
shorti_trend_radar: inputSchema  parameters: -'en' answers in +'en': -English: +English; -input.limit description: How many formats.
shorti_video: description, inputSchema  -detail='full' adds every field.  parameters: -input.cursor description: A previous answer's next_cursor. -summary: the compact answer, prompts for a model marked for_model. -'en' answers in +'en': -English: +English;
shorti_what_to_shoot: inputSchema  parameters: -'en' answers in +'en': -English: +English; -input.limit description: How many formats.
